{{Quote|There's still time to call this off, you know. Maybe make a few more test flights through Jag Crag Gorge before&hellip;''"<br />"''No can do, Biggs. I was born for this.|[[Biggs Darklighter]] and Luke Skywalker|<ref name="SW15">[[Star Wars (2015) 15|''Star Wars'' (2015) 15]]</ref>}}
'''Jag Crag Gorge''' was a gorge located near the [[city]] of [[Mos Espa]] on the [[planet]] [[Tatooine]]. At the time of the [[Invasion of Naboo]], Jag Crag Gorge was part of the [[Boonta Eve Classic]] [[podracing]] circuit, and [[pilot]]s such as [[Anakin Skywalker]] raced through it.<ref name="TPM" /> [[Standard year|Years]] later, Skywalker's son, [[Luke Skywalker|Luke]], piloted his [[T-16 skyhopper|T-16 Skyhopper]] through the gorge before attempting to maneuver though [[Beggar's Canyon]].<ref name="SW15" />

